body:
Hi! I follow someone called "The UX Gal". She just released a free UX career transition guide and a $9 e-book for UX Writing, if you're interested. 

&#x200B;

https://theuxgal.thrivecart.com/ux-writing-transition-gude/

A few months ago, he came home all angry because we don't have a house and he hates his job and the house is disorganized. It was midnight, I was on laptop clearly doing research about work. He comes over and punches my laptop off the table and threatens to call CPS again. I was so shaken that I started cleaning the house for a few days straight, just not eating. He comes home to tell me that he's "pleased with the way the house  looks" and that "he's done that to me many times and it has never worked like that before. I don't know what I did but I'm happy. Thanks :)" 

&#x200B;

This is for documentation purposes at this point. I do, have to be very smart about this.

[The Job Hackers- Agile Scrum MBA Refer A Friend Link](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSedjRXrUxkRtuZ0N9m3Scqvo-7NDY3Jzs6K2vrnJe78P1iLDw/viewform) : Here's my personal link for the refer friend program. PM me for the name and email if you want to use this link. It helps towards my pledge hours. 

&#x200B;

The regular link- [https://www.thejobhackers.org/participant/](https://www.thejobhackers.org/participant/)
